---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Packages"
  description="Base, Premium, and Monthly Advisory support for swim recruiting. Compare what is included at each level and choose the right fit for your athlete."
>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">SDA Packages</span>
<h1>Support catered to your <em>recruiting goals.</em></h1>
<p>Every athlete is different. Choose the level of support that aligns with what your family needs.</p>
</div>
</header>

<!-- BASE & PREMIUM -->
<section>
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<span class="eyebrow">One-Time Packages</span>
<h2>Choose your level of support</h2>
<p>Each package start with an honest assessment of where your athlete stands, while premium adds deeper academic, performance, application, and developmental support.</p>
</div>

<div class="package-grid">

<div class="package-card" id="base">
<span class="package-label">Base</span>
<h2>Base Package</h2>
<div class="package-price">$1,000 <span>one-time</span></div>
<p class="package-desc">A structured recruiting foundation for families who want to understand where their athlete stands and how to move forward.</p>
<p class="package-subhead">Your Base Package includes:</p>
<ul class="package-list">
<li>SDA Compass</li>
<li>Recruiting timeline & strategy session</li>
<li>Mock coach recruiting session & official visit preparedness</li>
<li>Parent strategy session</li>
</ul>
<p class="package-best"><strong>Best for:</strong> Families seeking clarity, direction, and a personalized recruiting strategy without full academic and performance support.</p>
<a class="btn-gold" href="../contact/">Get Started</a>
</div>

<div class="package-card featured" id="premium">
<span class="package-tag">Most Comprehensive</span>
<span class="package-label">Premium</span>
<h2>Premium Package</h2>
<div class="package-price">$2,000 <span>one-time</span></div>
<p class="package-desc">Our most comprehensive one-time package, bringing recruiting strategy together with academic, performance, application, and athlete-development support.</p>
<p class="package-subhead">Your Premium Package includes:</p>
<ul class="package-list">
<li>Everything included in Base</li>
<li>Academic strategy session</li>
<li>Improving athletic performance session</li>
<li>Essay coaching for Common App & supplements with tracker</li>
<li>Access to the SDA Network</li>
<li>Pre-hab, dryland, warm-up & meet-day catalog</li>
<li>Personalized training toward identified gaps</li>
<li>Nutrition & fueling educational resources</li>
</ul>
<p class="package-best"><strong>Best for:</strong> Athletes who want recruiting, academics, performance, and application support integrated in one strategy.</p>
<a class="btn-gold" href="../contact/">Get Started</a>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- MONTHLY -->
<section class="advisory" id="advisory">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="advisory-card">
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">Ongoing Support</span>
<h2>Monthly Advisory</h2>
<p>Recruiting is constantly moving. Monthly Advisory provides continued access to SDA so your plan can evolve with your athlete's progression.</p>
<ul class="advisory-list">
<li>SDA Compass updated monthly</li>
<li>3 × 30 minute sessions within your package</li>
<li>Consistent email support within 48 hour response window</li>
<li>Continued recruiting strategy and support</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="advisory-side">
<div class="advisory-price">$250 <small>/ month</small></div>
<p>Designed as ongoing support after your initial SDA package.</p>
<a class="btn-gold" href="../contact/">Ask About Monthly Advisory</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- COMPARISON -->
<section class="comparison">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<h2>Compare Packages</h2>
</div>

<div class="table-wrap">
<table class="compare-table">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Service</th>
<th>Base<span>$1,000</span></th>
<th>Premium<span>$2,000</span></th>
<th>Monthly Advisory<span>$250 / mo</span></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>SDA Compass</td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">Updated monthly</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Recruiting timeline & strategy session</td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">Within monthly sessions</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Academic strategy session</td>
<td class="no"></td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">Within package</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Nutrition & improving performance session</td>
<td class="no"></td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">Within package</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Mock coach recruiting & visit session</td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">Within monthly sessions</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Parent strategy session</td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">Within monthly sessions</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Consistent email support — 48-hour response window</td>
<td class="no"></td>
<td class="no"></td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Essay coaching — Common App & Supplements & Tracker</td>
<td class="no"></td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">3 × 30-min sessions</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>SDA network access</td>
<td class="no"></td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">Based on package</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Pre-hab, dryland, warm-up & meet-day catalog</td>
<td class="no"></td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">Based on package</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Personalized training toward gaps</td>
<td class="no"></td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">Based on package</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Nutrition & Fueling Educational Resources</td>
<td class="no"></td>
<td class="yes">Included</td>
<td class="note">Based on package</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<!-- CLOSING -->
<section class="closing">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Not sure which package fits?</h2>
<p>Start with a free consultation. We'll learn where your athlete is in the recruiting process and help determine the most appropriate level of support.</p>
<a class="btn-gold" href="../contact/">Book a Free Consultation</a>
</div>
</section>

</Base>

<style is:global>
/* nav */
nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(15,42,74,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,161,59,.25)}

/* hero */
.hero{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:100px 0 90px;text-align:center}
.hero .eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:20px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,64px);max-width:820px;margin:0 auto 24px}
.hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-soft)}
.hero p{font-size:18px;color:#C7D2DE;max-width:690px;margin:0 auto}

/* general */
section{padding:88px 0}
.section-head{max-width:700px;margin-bottom:48px}
.section-head .eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:16px}
.section-head h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,42px);color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:16px}
.section-head p{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted)}

/* package cards */
.package-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px}
.package-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:38px 34px;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.package-card.featured{border:1.5px solid var(--gold)}
.package-tag{position:absolute;top:-11px;left:32px;background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:2px;font-weight:500}
.package-label{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.7px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:14px}
.package-card h2{font-size:30px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:10px}
.package-price{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:21px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:22px}
.package-price span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.package-desc{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:26px}
.package-subhead{font-size:13px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}
.package-list{list-style:none;margin-bottom:26px}
.package-list li{font-size:14px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.package-list li::before{content:"—";color:var(--gold);margin-right:10px}
.package-best{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:auto;padding-top:6px}
.package-best strong{color:var(--navy)}
.btn-gold{display:inline-block;background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy);padding:14px 26px;border-radius:2px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-top:24px;transition:all .2s}
.btn-gold:hover{background:var(--gold-soft);transform:translateY(-1px)}

/* advisory */
.advisory{background:var(--white-warm);padding-top:20px}
.advisory-card{background:var(--navy);border-radius:8px;padding:42px 44px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:60px;color:#fff}
.advisory-card .eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:14px}
.advisory-card h2{font-size:32px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:14px}
.advisory-card p{font-size:15px;color:#A9B7C6}
.advisory-list{list-style:none;margin-top:22px}
.advisory-list li{font-size:14px;color:#D5DEE7;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
.advisory-list li::before{content:"—";color:var(--gold);margin-right:10px}
.advisory-side{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);padding-left:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.advisory-price{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:26px;color:var(--gold-soft);margin-bottom:8px}
.advisory-price small{font-size:12px;color:#A9B7C6}
.advisory-side p{font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:5px}

/* comparison */
.comparison{background:#fff}
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}
.compare-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:760px}
.compare-table th{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:20px 18px;text-align:center;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:500}
.compare-table th:first-child{text-align:left}
.compare-table th span{display:block;color:var(--gold-soft);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;margin-top:4px}
.compare-table td{padding:15px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:center;font-size:14px}
.compare-table td:first-child{text-align:left;color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}
.compare-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.yes{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600}
.yes::before{content:"✓";color:var(--gold);margin-right:5px}
.no{color:#9A9890}
.no::before{content:"—"}
.note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}
.table-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px}

/* extras */
.extras{background:var(--cream-2)}
.extras-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}
.extra-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 20px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center}
.extra-card h3{font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600}
.extra-card p{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

/* closing */
.closing{text-align:center;background:var(--cream)}
.closing h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);color:var(--navy);max-width:650px;margin:0 auto 18px}
.closing p{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);max-width:530px;margin:0 auto}

/* footer */
footer{background:var(--navy-deep);color:#8FA0B3;padding:52px 0 38px}

@media(max-width:800px){.package-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.advisory-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.advisory-side{border-left:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);padding-left:0;padding-top:28px}.extras-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(max-width:500px){.extras-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding:75px 0 70px}}
</style>
